From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 14:02:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 012/140] feat(player): add professional media scopes

Add selected-track multichannel audio waveforms and realtime luma, RGBY, and vectorscope analysis to the video player. Include configurable performance settings, responsive overlays, keyboard shortcuts, localized UI, and Aagedal Media Player attribution.
